§ P1A.ABI9001.NOMINAL.RECORD.ACCEPTANCE @2026-09-08

I> authority := user.authorized.local.compiler.code+tests+commit+push.
I> scope := declaration-backed.natural-layout.integer-record construction
  + projection + identity across CSSLv3.HIR → MIR → Cranelift.{object,JIT}
  + exact Windows.x64.C aggregate boundary ; unsupported cases fail typed.
