§C verdict
  ✓ ABI9001 := BOUNDED_ACCEPT_CANDIDATE.
  ✓ exact claim := named declaration-backed natural integer/bool records of exact
    size1|2|4|8 across layout-aware CSSLv3 MIR + Cranelift object/JIT construction,
    read-only projection, compiler-managed identity ; Windows.x64 raw-C proof exact
    for `{u32,u32}` by-value parameter+return.
  N! mutable record update | address identity | aliasing | nested aggregate |
    float|pointer field | packed/custom layout | size>8 | byref|sret | unwind |
    non-Windows raw-C ABI | non-Cranelift backend parity promoted.
  ✗ full.P1a.native.profile := INCOMPLETE despite sentinels9001..9005=0.
  ○ residual.P1a := manifest content-byte binding + canonical codec/multiblock SHA256
    + RNG admission + normalization + nonvacuous executable NIL
    + non-Cranelift backend parity + root independent review
    + canonical Apocv4 evidence/graph integration.
  N! unsigned-comparison lane touched|depended-on ; dependency.conflict=none.
  N! merge|deployment|release|training|spend|runtime-cutover authority inferred.
  N! Apocv4 canonical six mutated.
  N! graphify-out staged|reverted ; foreign generated state preserved.

